<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39670" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικελεύ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exhort, encourage, cheer on</i>, c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεκέλευσά</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				1224
			</span></i> codd.: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1088
			</span></i>: c. acc. pers., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸν μὴ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διανοούμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.82
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. rei cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοῖς
				ἄλλοις κελεύσμασιν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τόδε "εὖ κύνες</span>" <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				6.20
			</span></i>; joined with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακελεύομαι</span>
			(which prop. means <i>cheer</i> one <i>on to an act not
			begun</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. <i>to one already
				begun</i>), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				61a
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ παραδιδόναι τὴν ἀρχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.28
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				77
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>give
				consent</i> or <i>authorization,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PPetr.
				3p.133
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				201
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>.</div>
